   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labs programme 2026-2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Launched in 2019, the Life and Building Safety (LABS) Initiative is a collaborative effort to drive the apparel and footwear industry towards safer working conditions at the members&#x2019; brands&#x2019; suppliers, with the intention to embed best practices into local legislation and protocols. LABS is a separate legal entity, where IDH act as the program secretariat, convening a strong coalition of global brands, key industry stakeholders, and decision-makers, including the private sector, governments, and civil society, to unlock resources and work towards preventing and mitigating fire, electrical, and structural risks in the apparel and footwear industry.</narrative>
  </description>
